Description: MaluDB Business OS kernel
 The kernel of the MaluDB Business OS: the estate (buildings, offices,
 desks), departments and people, the AI agent workforce (hiring, prompts,
 skills, tool grants, runs and a token ledger), single sign-on and the
 directory API for business applications, approvals and AI Ops.
 .
 A PHP JSON API behind Apache, a Next.js front end, Python MCP servers
 and the agent runner, with MaluDB as activity memory. The code lives in
 /var/www as upstream expects; the Composer dependencies, the built front
 end and the Python virtual environment are built into the package. A
 MaluOS first-boot component creates the kernel and memory databases, runs
 the migrations, configures Apache and the services and creates the first
 super-admin.
